==Russian==

===Etymology===
Presumably related to {{cog|lt|rusė́ti|t=to flow}}, {{m|lt|rusnóti|t=to flow slowly}}. Compare the name of the Lithuanian river {{m|lt|Raũsvė}}, and {{m|lt|Rusnìs}}, a right distributary of the Neman.

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|ру́сло}}
* {{audio|ru|Ru-русло.ogg}}

